.br
\fIoptions\fR ({ timeout?: number, responseType?: string, signal?: AbortSignal, cache?: boolean, useExtensionIPCIfAvailable?: boolean }; optional; default null)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<Result>\fR
.TP
\fBinflateIPCMessageTransfers(object, types)\fR
Rehydrates structured\-clone friendly IPC payloads back into richer runtime objects.
.br
This helper recursively reconstructs encoded `Buffer` instances, `IPCMessagePort` handles, and custom tagged values supplied in `types`.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIobject\fR (any; required)
.br
\fItypes\fR (Map<string, Function>; optional)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIany\fR
.TP
